;
1. Fixed Uiso
 At 1.2 times of:
  All C(H) groups, All N(H,H,H) groups
 At 1.5 times of:
  All C(H,H,H) groups
2.a Ternary CH refined with riding coordinates:
 C12(H12), C20(H20)
2.b Aromatic/amide H refined with riding coordinates:
 C3(H3), C4(H4), C5(H5), C6(H6), C7(H7), C9(H9), C14(H14), C15(H15), C16(H16),
 C17(H17)
2.c Idealised Me refined as rotating group:
 N1(H1A,H1B,H1C), N2(H2A,H2B,H2C), C8(H8A,H8B,H8C), C10(H10A,H10B,H10C)
